# Exact coverage for the exposed bus review

This file distinguishes complete scientific reads, reused instruction coverage, captured-only transitive material and actual executions. Reading a summary, storing bytes or verifying a hash is not recorded as a complete scientific read. The main source is the frozen author's self-contained 448-line DERIVATION, not an uninspected older parent theorem. Source identities are captured in SOURCE_MANIFEST.json and independently refreshed in SOURCE_REFRESH.json before the review freeze.

